{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--sakhalin-kanne-simultaneous-action","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--dialect-distribution"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, the conjunctive particle kanne expresses that an action is performed concurrently or in parallel with another action ('while', 'doing and...').","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において接続助詞 kanne は、継続的な動作と並行して他の動作が行われる同時性・付帯状況（「〜ながら、〜して」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kanne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0039-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0053-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0103-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--kor-marks-simultaneous-action","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--simultaneity"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunctive particle kor indicates that two actions take place simultaneously or marks attendant circumstances ('while', '-ing').","ja":"接続助詞 kor は、二つの行為が同時に行われることや付帯状況（「〜つつ、〜ながら、〜て」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0337-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0063-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--kor-permits-different-subjects","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--simultaneity"],"statement":{"en":"Unlike Japanese -tsutsu or nagara, the conjunctive particle kor expressing simultaneous or attendant action does not require the subjects of the two clauses to be identical.","ja":"日本語の「つつ」「ながら」と異なり、同時的状況や付帯状況を表す接続助詞 kor は前後の節で主語が異なっていても用いることができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0067-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0317-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0346-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--saru-kor-different-subjects","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--simultaneity"],"statement":{"en":"In the Saru dialect, the conjunctive particle kor 'while' can be used grammatically even when the preceding and following clauses have different subjects.","ja":"沙流方言において、接続助詞 kor「つつ、ながら」は前後の節で主語が一致していなくても文法的に用いることができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0377-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0381-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[{"kind":"refines","claim":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--kor-permits-different-subjects","differs_in":"dialect","note":"Exemplifies the general lack of subject-identity constraint specifically in the Saru dialect."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--the-suffix-ike-also-hike-forms-nouns-from","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses"],"statement":{"en":"The suffix -ike (also hike) forms nouns from verbs or adjectives meaning 'good thing/person', etc., and when introducing a subordinate clause, it expresses meanings such as 'as', 'when', or 'while'.","ja":"語尾-ike（hikeとも）は名詞を作って「よいこと・物・者」などの意を表し、副文章を導いてas, when, while等の意味になる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["-ike","-hike"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0063-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--the-conjunctive-particle-yayne-indicates-that-the-next","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunctive particle yayne indicates that the next action occurs around the time when a long continued or repeated action ends ('while doing, and finally doing').","ja":"接続助詞 yayne は長く継続され、あるいは繰り返された動作の終る頃に次の動作が起ることを表す（「〜ながら、〜して、ずっと〜して終に〜する」）。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yayne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0039-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--in-elder-speech-the-conjunctive-particle-ko-ekaari","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses"],"statement":{"en":"In elder speech, the conjunctive particle ko'ekaari expresses that another action occurs midway through an ongoing action ('in the middle of', 'on the way').","ja":"老人の言葉において接続助詞 ko'ekaari はある行動が行われている中間点で他の行動が起きることを表す（「〜の最中に、〜の途中で」）。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["elder speech"]},"forms":["ko'ekaari"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0040-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--in-many-dialects-other-than-saru-and-chitose","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--dialect-distribution"],"statement":{"en":"In many dialects other than Saru and Chitose, kane is used with high frequency like kor to indicate that two actions are performed in parallel.","ja":"沙流方言や千歳方言以外の多くの方言では、kane はそれらの方言よりも高頻度で用いられ、kor と同様に動作が並行して行われることを表すのに用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["沙流方言・千歳方言以外の多くの方言"]},"forms":["kane"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0339-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--in-the-tokachi-dialect-the-form-kan-is","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--dialect-distribution"],"statement":{"en":"In the Tokachi dialect, the form kan is used in addition to kane, basically also indicating that actions are performed in parallel.","ja":"十勝方言では kane に加えて kan という形が使われ、これも基本的には動作が並行して行われることを指す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/central/tokachi"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kan","kane"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0339-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--in-the-saru-dialect-the-conjunctionalizer-kor-has","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--dialect-distribution"],"statement":{"en":"In the Saru dialect, the conjunctionalizer kor has two meanings: simultaneity (corresponding to Shizunai kane) and inevitable consequence (corresponding to Shizunai konno).","ja":"沙流方言の接続詞 kor には、同時性（静内方言の kane に相当）と必然的結果（静内方言の konno に相当）という2つの異なる意味がある。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor","kane","konno"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0244-01","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--in-western-hokkaido-dialects-kor-describes-simultaneity-between","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--dialect-distribution"],"statement":{"en":"In western Hokkaido dialects, kor describes simultaneity between two predicates, whereas kane is a verbal auxiliary expressing surprise.","ja":"北海道西部方言では kor が2つの述語の同時性を表すのに対し、kane は述語に意外のニュアンスを付与する動詞助動詞である。"},"type":"variation","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor","kane"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0244-07","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--the-element-kor-is-not-a-postpositional-case","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--form-environments"],"statement":{"en":"The element kor is not a postpositional case particle, but a particle that conjoins two predicates.","ja":"korは後置詞的格助詞ではなく、2つの述語を接続する助詞である。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2006@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0006-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--the-conjunction-kor-expresses-simultaneous-coordination-while-or","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--form-environments"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunction kor expresses simultaneous coordination ('while') or conditional meaning ('when/if', equivalent to ko).","ja":"kor は「つつ」（同時並列）を表し、また条件「と」（= ko）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor","ko"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0160-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--with-the-conjunctive-particle-kor-while-the-subjects","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--simultaneity"],"statement":{"en":"With the conjunctive particle kor 'while', the subjects of the preceding and following clauses do not necessarily have to be identical.","ja":"kor「ながら」は前後の主語が必ずしも同じでなくても構わない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0361-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--the-conjunctive-particle-kor-expresses-simultaneous-circumstances","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--simultaneity"],"statement":{"en":"The conjunctive particle kor expresses simultaneous circumstances.","ja":"接続助詞 kor は同時的状況を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0372-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--kor-functions-as-a-conjunctive-particle-meaning-while","revision":1,"topic":"topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topics":["topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses","topic:complex/simultaneous-kor-clauses--simultaneity"],"statement":{"en":"kor functions as a conjunctive particle meaning 'while, as, and'.","ja":"kor は「〜つつ，ながら，と」を意味する接続助詞である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["kor"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0386-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
